   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "nanosleep — high resolution sleep",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_365_02\" id=\"tag_17_365_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00004",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]\n[CODE4]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt><sup>[<a href=\"javascript:open_code('CX')\">CX</a>]</sup> <img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\"> #include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/time.h.html\">time.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint nanosleep(const struct timespec *</tt><i>rqtp</i><tt>, struct timespec *</tt><i>rmtp</i><tt>); <img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\"></tt></code>"
     },
     "CODE4": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<tt><br></tt>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A5][/A5]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A5": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_365_03\" id=\"tag_17_365_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I6]nanosleep[/I6]() function shall cause the current thread to be suspended from execution until either the time interval\nspecified by the [I7]rqtp[/I7] argument has elapsed or a signal is delivered to the calling thread, and its action is to invoke a\nsignal-catching function or to terminate the process. The suspension time may be longer than requested because the argument value\nis rounded up to an integer multiple of the sleep resolution or because of the scheduling of other activity by the system. But,\nexcept for the case of being interrupted by a signal, the suspension time shall not be less than the time specified by [I8]rqtp[/I8],\nas measured by the system clock CLOCK_REALTIME.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The use of the [I9]nanosleep[/I9]() function has no effect on the action or blockage of any signal.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00008",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A10][/A10]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A10": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_365_04\" id=\"tag_17_365_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "If the [I11]nanosleep[/I11]() function returns because the requested time has elapsed, its return value shall be zero.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     3
    ],
    "text": "If the [I12]nanosleep[/I12]() function returns because it has been interrupted by a signal, it shall return a value of -1 and set\n[I13]errno[/I13] to indicate the interruption. If the [I14]rmtp[/I14] argument is non-NULL, the [B15]timespec[/B15] structure referenced by it\nis updated to contain the amount of time remaining in the interval (the requested time minus the time actually slept). The\n[I16]rqtp[/I16] and [I17]rmtp[/I17] arguments can point to the same object. If the [I18]rmtp[/I18] argument is NULL, the remaining time is not\nreturned.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B15": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00011",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     5
    ],
    "text": "If [I19]nanosleep[/I19]() fails, it shall return a value of -1 and set [I20]errno[/I20] to indicate the error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I19": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00012",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A21][/A21]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A21": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_365_05\" id=\"tag_17_365_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00013",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I22]nanosleep[/I22]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00014",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EINTR]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00015",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I23]nanosleep[/I23]() function was interrupted by a signal.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I23": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00016",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EINVAL]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00017",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [I24]rqtp[/I24] argument specified a nanosecond value less than zero or greater than or equal to 1000 million.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00018",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[A25][/A25]EXAMPLES",
    "placeholders": {
     "A25": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_365_06\" id=\"tag_17_365_06\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00019",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
