    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [ENOSYS] error condition has been removed as stubs need not be provided if an implementation does not support the Timers\noption.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00036",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     5
    ],
    "text": "IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001/Cor&nbsp;1-2002, item XSH/TC1/D6/37 is applied, updating the SEE ALSO section to include the\n[A53][I54]clock_nanosleep[/I54]()[/A53] function.",
    "placeholders": {
